From: local
Subject: [PATCH] appicons adapted for dwm 6.8 + prior patches

Show per-rule app icons on tags. Merged with alttagsdecoration:
empty tags use tags[], occupied without icons use alttags[],
tags with appicons use built icon strings. Frees tag_icons each
drawbar to avoid the stock leak. Keeps barpadding/centered title.

